{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winoa Wizard is a new witch! ready to start her quest to become the greatest witch alive! Unfortunately for her, the evil witch at Pigarse's school of Uptight witches, Catrina Underwood Nathanial Trotwether, has other plans. Sending evil wizards and witches after Winoa to stop her journey to become a great witch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras/371acb1d969c7d94ed5245ef12761d95.avif?t=1773234001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras_big/371acb1d969c7d94ed5245ef12761d95.avif?t=1773234001 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a variety of enemies helmed by the evil Catrina! 4 Unique stages, each with their own soundtrack to bop too while fighting your enemies!!<strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras/0abe50e125a0f139ee32ddb029e83948.avif?t=1773234001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras_big/0abe50e125a0f139ee32ddb029e83948.avif?t=1773234001 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did your favorite childhood author call for your eradication? So did mine! Politicians suck, and they suck even more here! Fight through and find a variety of enemies inspired by British and American figures in this Satire of the world we live in oh god </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras/127cb379ec22496cf73ab6f2dd203404.avif?t=1773234001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3